IMPORT prelude

-- Section 5 of the Legislation Interpretation Act 2021 (South Australia): references to professions registered under the Health Practitioner Regulation National Law.
-- The table in s 5(1) is held as data, one entry for each row, with the profession, whether students are excluded and the division a row requires read out of column 2.
-- Section 5(3) is a power of the Governor to amend the table by regulation and has no entry here.

§ `Section 5 -- References to professions registered under the National Law`

DECLARE `Row of the table in section 5(1)` HAS
    `column 1`                        IS A STRING
    `column 2`                        IS A STRING
    profession                        IS A STRING
    `students are excluded`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `a division is required`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `line in the text file`           IS A NUMBER

-- src:253 | | chiropractor | a person registered under the Health Practitioner Regulation National Law to practise in the chiropractic profession (other than as a student) |
@ref s 5(1) table row 1 (src:253)
`s 5(1) row 1` MEANS `Row of the table in section 5(1)` WITH
    `column 1` IS "chiropractor"
    `column 2` IS "a person registered under the Health Practitioner Regulation National Law to practise in the chiropractic profession (other than as a student)"
    profession IS "chiropractic"
    `students are excluded` IS TRUE
    `a division is required` IS FALSE
    `line in the text file` IS 253

-- src:254 | | dental practitioner | a person registered under the Health Practitioner Regulation National Law to practise in the dental profession (including, if appropriate, a dental therapist, dental hygienist, dental prosthetist or oral health therapist but not including a student) |
@ref s 5(1) table row 2 (src:254)
`s 5(1) row 2` MEANS `Row of the table in section 5(1)` WITH
    `column 1` IS "dental practitioner"
    `column 2` IS "a person registered under the Health Practitioner Regulation National Law to practise in the dental profession (including, if appropriate, a dental therapist, dental hygienist, dental prosthetist or oral health therapist but not including a student)"
    profession IS "dental"
    `students are excluded` IS TRUE
    `a division is required` IS FALSE
    `line in the text file` IS 254

-- src:255 | | dentist | a person registered under the Health Practitioner Regulation National Law— (a) to practise in the dental profession as a dentist (other than as a student); and (b) in the dentists division of that profession |
@ref s 5(1) table row 3 (src:255)
`s 5(1) row 3` MEANS `Row of the table in section 5(1)` WITH
    `column 1` IS "dentist"
    `column 2` IS "a person registered under the Health Practitioner Regulation National Law— (a)	to practise in the dental profession as a dentist (other than as a student); and (b)	in the dentists division of that profession"
    profession IS "dental"
    `students are excluded` IS TRUE
    `a division is required` IS TRUE
    `line in the text file` IS 255

-- src:256 | | enrolled nurse | a person registered under the Health Practitioner Regulation National Law— (a) to practise in the nursing profession as a nurse (other than as a student); and (b) in the enrolled nurses division of that profession |
